    "enUS": {
      "description": "I have a confession to make. Lady Amberhall did send me to collect those samples, but in truth I volunteered. Sunnyglade was my home before the war took it from me, and I could not rest knowing monsters still taint it. Be it horde or Twilight.\r\n\r\nThere is no victory here by learning from them. There's nothing to learn. They're beasts, plain and simple, and should be put down like beasts.\r\n\r\nWe must slay their master at the bottom of this cave and bring an end to this. Surely my mistress will understand.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Chogg's Head",
          "type": "item"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Zac's Head",
          "type": "item"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Kill Chogg'Zac in the caves beneath Sunnyglade and retrieve their heads for Apprentice Claire.",
      "title": "Cut Off the Heads",
